{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_ttr_21_1","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_21","textTraditional":"【經】","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_ttr_21_2","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_21","textTraditional":"十年春王正月，庚申，曹伯終生卒。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_ttr_21_3","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_21","textTraditional":"夏五月，葬曹桓公。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_ttr_21_4","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_21","textTraditional":"秋，公會衛侯于桃丘，弗遇。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_ttr_21_5","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_21","textTraditional":"冬十有二月丙午，齊侯、衛侯、鄭伯來戰于郎。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_ttr_21_6","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_21","textTraditional":"【傳】","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_ttr_21_7","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_21","textTraditional":"十年春，曹桓公卒。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_ttr_21_8","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_21","textTraditional":"虢仲譖其大夫詹父於王。詹父有辭，以王師伐虢。夏，虢公出奔虞。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_ttr_21_9","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_21","textTraditional":"秋，秦人納芮伯萬于芮。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_ttr_21_10","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_21","textTraditional":"初，虞叔有玉，虞公求旃。弗獻。既而悔之。曰：「周諺有之：『匹夫無罪，懷璧其罪。』吾焉用此，其以賈害也？」乃獻之。又求其寶劍。叔曰：「是無厭也。無厭，將及我。」遂伐虞公，故虞公出奔共池。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_ttr_21_11","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_21","textTraditional":"冬，齊、衛、鄭來戰于郎，我有辭也。初，北戎病齊，諸侯救之。鄭公子忽有功焉。齊人餼諸侯，使魯次之。魯以周班後鄭。鄭人怒，請師於齊。齊人以衛師助之。故不稱侵伐。先書齊、衛，王爵也。","sentenceOrder":11}],"overrides":{}}